  "description": "Patent electronic application client library (NewRegisterOnlinePatent) and its directly referenced satellite assemblies from this repository.\n\n      The consuming application must still supply: DevExpress v21.2 (matching your licensed SKUs), other commercial or internal binaries from _DLL (Aspose, Spire, CPC interop, etc.), Word/CPC Config output under bin\\Config, Chilkat and CefSharp native layouts (x86/x64) where used, and call ChilkatAnyCpuLoader/CefSharpAnyCpuLoader at startup when applicable.\n\n      This package lists public NuGet dependencies only; it does not redistribute vendor-licensed components.\n\n      Includes IPS.CpcMdbBridge.x86.exe (32-bit Jet/OleDb bridge) under tools\\CpcMdbBridge. Import build\\NewRegisterOnlinePatent.targets in the host executable project to copy the bridge next to your main .exe at build time.",
